#!args --verify-dirty
# the live inspector's sources for the viewer (ui/inspect_src.rs; development builds): the
# records of ui.markdown_view and ui.html_view (headings, list items, links, the view's box)
# have the app's call as their source, not a line of lib/ui/md_view.rs
size 1000 720
theme light
wait 300
inspect expect idle
inspect on
inspect expect sources "apps/mdviewtest/"
inspect select "Hilfe"
inspect expect source "apps/mdviewtest/src/main.rs:"
inspect off
click "HTML"
expect heading:"HTML-Betrachter" value 1
inspect on
inspect expect sources "apps/mdviewtest/"
inspect select heading:"HTML-Betrachter"
inspect expect source "apps/mdviewtest/src/main.rs:"
inspect off
inspect expect idle
